      "source": "<a href=\"../../../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>Auto-configuration</code></a> for Spring Security's Filter.\nConfigured separately from <a href=\"ServletWebSecurityAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.security.autoconfigure.web.servlet\"><code>ServletWebSecurityAutoConfiguration</code></a> to ensure that\nthe filter's order is still configured when a user-provided\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/config/annotation/web/configuration/WebSecurityConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.config.annotation.web.configuration\"><code>WebSecurityConfiguration</code></a> exists.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>自动配置</code></a>用于 Spring Security 的 Filter。\n它与 <a href=\"ServletWebSecurityAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.security.autoconfigure.web.servlet\"><code>ServletWebSecurityAutoConfiguration</code></a> 分开配置，以确保当存在用户提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/config/annotation/web/configuration/WebSecurityConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.config.annotation.web.configuration\"><code>WebSecurityConfiguration</code></a> 时，Filter 的顺序仍然得到配置。",
